# Keep LF in the working tree for files whose line endings matter, even with core.autocrlf=true on Windows.
# Shell scripts: bash rejects CR ("set: pipefail\r: invalid option name").
# OBJ and JSON: AGREEMENT.md requires LF, and generated cases must be byte-identical on every platform.
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.obj  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
# SVG images in docs/images: written by m2w render with LF, kept byte-identical.
*.svg  text eol=lf
